{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the City of Spells. In this 2.5D adventure, you play as a magical detective named Allison, who returns to her hometown of New York City--only to find it overrun with crime, corruption, and <i>actual</i> DEMONS! Do you have what it takes to fend off Satan's army and restore virtue to a city ravaged by lust and greed?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Customizable Magic System</strong> \u2013 Solve crimes <i>and</i> fight demons your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Multi-Branching Story</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape the case <i>and</i> the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2a <strong>True-Crime Inspired Mysteries</strong> \u2013 Unravel chilling cases with a supernatural twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Anime Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A stylish blend of classic JRPG visuals and noir intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdd <strong>Character-Rich Narrative</strong> \u2013 A serious story that knows when to have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Crime, Cults, &amp; Chaos</strong> \u2013 Face off against anarcho-maoists and Yakuza-inspired crime lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An indie game for fans of visual novels, magical fantasy, and anime-inspired storytelling.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595850?t=1742583025","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595850?t=1742583025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/d07b34ab7c5957091dd5f1b8494ad765f3027063/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742583025","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/d07b34ab7c5957091dd5f1b8494ad765f3027063/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742583025","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the City of Spells. In this 2.5D adventure, you play as a magical detective named Allison, who returns to her hometown of New York City--only to find it overrun with crime, corruption, and <i>actual</i> DEMONS! Do you have what it takes to fend off Satan's army and restore virtue to a city ravaged by lust and greed?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Customizable Magic System</strong> \u2013 Solve crimes <i>and</i> fight demons your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Multi-Branching Story</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape the case <i>and</i> the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2a <strong>True-Crime Inspired Mysteries</strong> \u2013 Unravel chilling cases with a supernatural twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Anime Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A stylish blend of classic JRPG visuals and noir intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdd <strong>Character-Rich Narrative</strong> \u2013 A serious story that knows when to have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Crime, Cults, &amp; Chaos</strong> \u2013 Face off against anarcho-maoists and Yakuza-inspired crime lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An indie game for fans of visual novels, magical fantasy, and anime-inspired storytelling.</p>","developers":["Lando Ringel"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595850/56fee2dae8c4b98c2516eb53a2fa414c262b1c25/header.jpg?t=1742583025","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<b